===Verb===
{{en-verb|ransoms|ransoming|ransomed|ransomed}}

# {{context|14th century}} To [[deliver]], especially in context of [[sin]] or relevant penalties.
# To pay a price to set someone free from [[captivity]] or [[punishment]].

